10
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,220
But now it's over 50 degrees below zero

11
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,820
Do you want to watch us live and die?

12
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:42,820
Yo yo yo

13
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,420
Wasn't someone still in the group yesterday?

14
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,820
