16
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,820
Start moral kidnapping today

17
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,020
It’s as if the Internet has no memory

18
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,620
I'm not morally kidnapping

19
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,820
I just think you need to be humane
